{"page":524,"verses":[{"verse_key":"52:15","surah":52,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَسِحْرٌ هَـٰذَآ أَمْ أَنتُمْ لَا تُبْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So is this sorcery? Do you still not see it?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَسِحْرٌ","en_gloss":"Then is this magic","transliteration":"afasiḥ'run","verse_key":"52:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"Then is this magic","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"52:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"52:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"52:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"52:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُبْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"see","transliteration":"tub'ṣirūna","verse_key":"52:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"52:15"}]},{"verse_key":"52:16","surah":52,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"ٱصْلَوْهَا فَٱصْبِرُوٓا۟ أَوْ لَا تَصْبِرُوا۟ سَوَآءٌ عَلَيْكُمْ ۖ إِنَّمَا تُجْزَوْنَ مَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Burn in it––it makes no difference whether you bear it patiently or not–– you are only being repaid for what you have done.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱصْلَوْهَا","en_gloss":"Burn in it","transliteration":"iṣ'lawhā","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَٱصْبِرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"then be patient","transliteration":"fa-iṣ'birū","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَصْبِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"be patient","transliteration":"taṣbirū","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَوَآءٌ","en_gloss":"(it is) same","transliteration":"sawāon","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"52:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تُجْزَوْنَ","en_gloss"